{"n": 1057, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "1057.webp", "text": "==\n~\n\n; Ws\n\n54-1\n\n5412004 ADJUSTING SUN ROOF\n\nDescription:\n\nThis sun roof can be operated as a\n\nA) sliding roof and\n\nB) lifting roof.\n\nSwitching to lift is only. possible with the lid\nclosed.\n\nFor electric sun roofs by way of 3 microswitch\nwith the control switch in “close” position.\nFor ma nual sun roofs after overcoming a\nPressure point.\n\nIdeal Sun Roof Lid Settings:\n\nHeights:\n\nFront = 1 mm (0.040\") deeper than roof panel.\n\nRear = 1 mm (0.040\"’) higher than roof panel.\nAxial Setting:\n\nEqual distance at front and rear between lid\nand roof —epprox. 0.2 mm (0.008\"), check\nwith plastic gauge.\n\nCheck Velvet Strips:\n\nV = Front with sealing lip\n\nH = Rear without sealing lip\n\nOpen sun roof lid about 5 cm (2)\n\nPress off front roof liner frame.\n\nClose sun roof lid and slide back roof liner\nfrome completely.\n\nJastallation:\n\nClose sun roof lid.\n\nPull roof liner frame forward uniformly.\nOpen sun roof lid slightly, while holding root\nliner frame by hand.\n\nPress in holding clamps for front roof liner\nframe\n\nSun roof closed « position 0\nLock sun roof in position 0 on left and nght\nsides with a 4 mm key (1)\n\nNote: ;\nPlace key (1) in holder of guide pin (2) and\ninsert in hole of operating lever (3) and gate (4)\n\nLoosen screws (1 ... 3) on left and right sides\nwith Special Tools 00 2 102/103.\n\nSlide and adjust sun roof in slots.\n\nNote:\n\nReplace self-locking screws,\n\nTightening torque: 3.5 Nm (2.5 ft. Ibs.)", "words": [["==", 0.0502, 0.4775, 0.075, 0.4894], ["~", 0.0567, 0.4894, 0.0826, 0.502], [";", 0.079, 0.5378, 0.08, 0.5398], ["Ws", 0.112, 0.5371, 0.1231, 0.5484], ["54-1", 0.4701, 0.0292, 0.5223, 0.0524], ["5412004", 0.2649, 0.0743, 0.3141, 0.0849], ["ADJUSTING", 0.3267, 0.0736, 0.3891, 0.0849], ["SUN", 0.3931, 0.0743, 0.4144, 0.0849], ["ROOF", 0.4189, 0.0736, 0.4488, 0.0849], ["Description:", 0.2649, 0.1061, 0.3237, 0.1187], ["This", 0.2